# Deny-all with an explicit allowlist.
#
# This package is PUBLIC, and the directory it installs into (~/.claude) is Claude Code's live
# runtime directory — transcripts, prompt history, OAuth-bearing backups. Nothing here links
# that directory wholesale, but an allowlist fails safe if something ever lands in this tree
# that should not be published: a new file type has to be admitted on purpose.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/install.sh
!/settings.base.json
!/statusline-command.sh
!/agents/
!/commands/
!/rules/
!/skills/
!/hooks/
!/scripts/
!/tests/

# settings.json is never stored here. It is GENERATED from settings.base.json plus a private
# overlay in the memory vault ($MEMORY_VAULT_PATH/personal/claude/settings.overlay.json).
# settings.local.json is never managed at all.

# Never share, even from an allowlisted directory.
*.log
*.bak
*.bak.*
.DS_Store
.skill-execution-context.json
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
dist/
